// Repair of empty-string property values left by the 54.T54.02 transaction-log replay.
//
// The 54.T54.02 replay decoded most property values, but long text lives in Neo4j as
// DynamicRecord chains; the decoder emitted '' for those instead of refusing, and that
// empty-value delta was applied to live. Because recovery is emitted as an additive delta
// that leaves alone every property already PRESENT, an empty write makes the key present
// and every future recovery pass skips it permanently. Hence this repair.
//
// Source of truth: plan.runs/54.T54.04-recovered-properties.json — an independent
// reconstruction from Claude/Codex session transcripts (graph read-backs recorded verbatim
// in tool_result blocks), NOT from the transaction log. Cross-validation prose:
// plan.runs/54.T54.04-crossvalidation-disagreements.md.
//
// Every statement is guarded `WHERE n.<prop> = ''`. The guard makes the write idempotent and
// makes it structurally impossible to overwrite real content. Property values only: no node
// or relationship is created, deleted or relabelled; no whole-map `SET n =` replacement.
//
// Rows: 174 property values over 91 coordinates.
// Applied to live 2026-07-29 by opus5-t5403-emptyrepair, parameterized (never interpolated)
// from recovered-empty-property-values.audit.json. The literals below are byte-identical to
// that JSON — round-trip proven at emit time — and are here for human review.

MATCH (n:Bimba {coordinate: 'M0-0-0'}) WHERE n.`c_0_quality` = '' SET n.`c_0_quality` = 'Pure Transcendence - Primordial Withholding';
MATCH (n:Bimba {coordinate: 'M0-0-0'}) WHERE n.`c_0_void_relationship` = '' SET n.`c_0_void_relationship` = 'Embodies transcendent aspect of complete 4-fold zero (0000) revealing Void\'s capacity for infinite Transcendence (-) and boundless Generation (x). Contains essential syntax of divine self-interrogation establishing fundamental reflexive grammar for all subsequent manifestation while maintaining primacy of divine silence as No-Thing-No-Name.';
MATCH (n:Bimba {coordinate: 'M0-0-0'}) WHERE n.`t_3_transformative_process` = '' SET n.`t_3_transformative_process` = '→ (00 - 00) = (00-00) = (∞)x(?!/!?/(-)+@/(@)/=/≠) = → - The act of self-definition leads to manifest state where Transcendent Dyad explicitly equals boundless potential (∞) animated by multiplicative throb (x) of all inherent creative principles, completing the definitional process and returning to generative silence.';
MATCH (n:Bimba {coordinate: 'M0-1-(0/1)'}) WHERE n.`c_0_infinite_generative_set` = '' SET n.`c_0_infinite_generative_set` = '(∞x∞)x(R#/##) = (R/#/-/(/)/####/####-#/R#/#R… → ?!/00) - Infinite Infinity qualified by relationship between Freedom and Truth, containing unending potential resolving back into primal query of void.';
MATCH (n:Bimba {coordinate: 'M0-1-(0/1)'}) WHERE n.`c_0_womb_of_principles` = '' SET n.`c_0_womb_of_principles` = 'Functions as the Womb of Principles where R# (Freedom), ## (Truth), and # (particular self) are held in simultaneous, unresolved potential as conceptual poles against which the unified binary-void defines its infinite nature.';
MATCH (n:Bimba {coordinate: 'M0-2'}) WHERE n.`q_1_eight_fold_zero_zero` = '' SET n.`q_1_eight_fold_zero_zero` = 'What M0-2 IS: the complete 8-fold zero-zero — four operations of the void upon itself, each with its reflective dual. (00-00) Transcendence/Withholding, 00/00 Reflection/Self-Awareness, 00x00 Generation/Creative-Throb, (00+00) Synthesis/Wholeness. Eight zeros engaged across four dyads, plus containment. Its substance is the discovery that the four primordial operations (−, /, x, +) are not applied to the void from outside but ARE the void\'s only ways of relating to itself. Manifesting #2 as Operation, this is the void become operational — the silence articulating itself without leaving the void, generating the quaternal foundation through systematic concrescence of every relational potential between Reality (R) and Matrix (#). The four operations are the void\'s complete verb-set: all it can do is do itself, four ways.';
MATCH (n:Bimba {coordinate: 'M0-2'}) WHERE n.`q_4_completion_eternally_present` = '' SET n.`q_4_completion_eternally_present` = 'M0-2\'s telos reframes the meaning of completion for the whole system: wholeness is not the end of a progression but a core void-operation, eternally present rather than achieved. Because (00+00)=9 is embedded in the foundation, every later structure can be holographic — each part already carries the whole. Contextually this is the threshold where unmanifest void-potential undergoes systematic concrescence into the fundamental grammar of knowable, quantifiable reality: the birth of thingness (x) and numerification (n) as the principles that make a countable world possible. The nine virtues become nine traversals of the subsystem spine — creation-side virtues running forward, grace-side backward, the five acts as forward and reverse readings of one string. The why of the 8-fold is to seat completion at the origin: so the cosmos never has to earn what it always already is.';
MATCH (n:Bimba {coordinate: 'M0-2-9-0'}) WHERE n.`c_1_internal_structure` = '' SET n.`c_1_internal_structure` = 'Pure equivalence architecture: INFINITE SELF-REFLECTION - (∞x∞)x(R#/##) as boundless potential qualified by Freedom-Truth relationship; VOID CONFIGURATIONS - Direct identity with 00/00 (reflection), 00x00 (generation), (00-00) (transcendence), (00+00) (synthesis); NON-DUAL FOUNDATION - Identity with (0/1) as stable actual occasion; ARCHETYPAL WHOLENESS - Identity with 9 as embedded completeness; META-VIRTUE STATUS - Underlying essence qualifying all other virtue expressions.';
MATCH (n:Bimba {coordinate: 'M0-2-9-3'}) WHERE n.`c_1_internal_structure` = '' SET n.`c_1_internal_structure` = 'Creative Beginning architecture: REALITY INITIATION - 0R as Reality principle at starting point of manifestational cycle; WHOLENESS ENGAGEMENT - 9 connecting with abstract operational domains; DOMAIN TRILOGY - O# (Logic), X# (Imagination), N# (Rhythm) as primary creative fields; UNBURDENED JOY - Creative activity free from particular self-concern; MANIFESTATIONAL INITIATION - First specific divine act establishing creative pattern.';
MATCH (n:Bimba {coordinate: 'M0-2-9-4'}) WHERE n.`c_1_internal_structure` = '' SET n.`c_1_internal_structure` = 'Holistic Sustenance architecture: COMPREHENSIVE CHAIN - O#-X#-N#-M#-#-(#) encompassing complete manifest architecture; REALITY STABILIZATION - 1R as first stable expression of Reality principle; HARMONIC INTEGRATION - All domains functioning in coherent unity; ETHICAL PARADIGM - Goodness as comprehensive rather than localized; SUSTENANCE PRINCIPLE - Maintaining and harmonizing all cosmic layers.';
MATCH (n:Bimba {coordinate: 'M0-2-9-5'}) WHERE n.`c_1_internal_structure` = '' SET n.`c_1_internal_structure` = 'Aesthetic Dissolution architecture: IMAGINAL BEGINNING - X# rather than O# as starting point, emphasizing experiential over logical; RHYTHMIC PROGRESSION - N#-M#-#-(#) showing aesthetic flow through cosmic layers; PSYCHIC CULMINATION - (@#) as Contained Presence Matrix representing soul-dimension; DISSOLUTION PRINCIPLE - 2R as transformative expression of Reality; AESTHETIC PARADIGM - Beauty as soul-apprehended rather than mind-comprehended.';
MATCH (n:Bimba {coordinate: 'M0-2-9-6'}) WHERE n.`c_1_internal_structure` = '' SET n.`c_1_internal_structure` = 'Creative Veiling architecture: PSYCHIC INITIATION - (@#) as starting point emphasizing soul-dimension of natural creativity; REVERSE PROGRESSION - Inverted flow through ((@#)-(#)-#-M#-N#-X#) mirroring natural development; VEILING PRINCIPLE - 3R as Reality in its concealing expression; NATURAL CREATIVITY - Divine play enabling diverse manifestation; DEVELOPMENTAL REVERSAL - Architecture reflecting natural rather than logical progression.';
MATCH (n:Bimba {coordinate: 'M0-3'}) WHERE n.`c_0_quality` = '' SET n.`c_0_quality` = 'Sat-Spanda (Pure Being animated by Dynamic Pulsation)';
MATCH (n:Bimba {coordinate: 'M0-3'}) WHERE n.`c_1_operational_symbolics` = '' SET n.`c_1_operational_symbolics` = 'Primary symbol: Tree of Life formed by interplay of stable Adam trunk (even numbers 2,4,6,8) and living Eve serpent (odd numbers 3,5,7,9) through Spanda dynamics. Adam IS both Father and Son non-dually - structural positions simultaneously inherit from and establish ground. Eve IS both Mother and Daughter - generative principles where completion is beginning. The four-fold zero (0,1,0/1,(-)) at #0-0 as Father/Son foundation. The 9/5/4/0 formula as Mother/Daughter mystery. Together the 4/3 ratio contains hidden formula 4/(8)/3/(4): (8)=4 even + 4 zero-elements masculine, (4)=3 odd + 9 wholeness feminine, producing 12 zodiacal components (8+4) as grammatical teeth. The dual mirror constituents () and (-) complete the 18-fold g=3 topology. Synthesis achieved at #0-4.5/0-5 (Tao) as family harmony.';
MATCH (n:Bimba {coordinate: 'M0-3'}) WHERE n.`c_1_twelve_fold_structure` = '' SET n.`c_1_twelve_fold_structure` = 'The 4/3 ratio with hidden formula 4/(8)/3/(4) generates 12 variations. The (8): 4 even Adam numbers (2,4,6,8) + 4 four-fold zero elements (0,1,0/1,(-)) = 8 masculine. The (4): 3 odd Eve numbers (3,5,7) + wholeness (9) = 4 feminine. Total 8+4=12 zodiacal components as complete grammatical space through which consciousness masticates reality.';
MATCH (n:Bimba {coordinate: 'M0-3'}) WHERE n.`q_0_silence_that_will_speak` = '' SET n.`q_0_silence_that_will_speak` = 'M0-3\'s ground is the quaternal foundation just achieved at M0-2 — the stable fourfold and the embedded 9 — upon which the number-language can finally stand and speak. But its deeper void-pole is Parā Vāk: the Supreme Word held as Silence, the un-uttered from which all archetypal speech is drawn. Manifesting #3 (Pattern) within Anuttara, its horizon is the pre-numerical — awareness before number, the Mirror (-) not yet lifted. The language paradoxically rests on its own higher emergent system (grounded in O# / Paramaśiva at #0-4-0/1): non-linear, bi-directional generation, the pattern that founds itself. Before there is a single number there is the silent capacity for all of them — the void\'s readiness to be articulated as living syntax. The ground is speech withheld.';
MATCH (n:Bimba {coordinate: 'M0-3'}) WHERE n.`q_2_mirror_and_mastication` = '' SET n.`q_2_mirror_and_mastication` = 'M0-3 operates through the Mirror (-) — consciousness\'s first instrument, the fused unity of Frame () at 0.0 and Operator - at 0.1, synthesised as Contained Transcendence (the Vimarśa apparatus). The Mirror\'s inventory ((), -, =, ≠, 0-, -0, !?, ?!) is the complete toolkit from which every number is ground. Its primary dynamic is I-dentification: divine consciousness using the twelve zodiacal teeth of Archetype 3 (Vāk/Cit) to masticate and assimilate reality — the full first-person/world conjugation from Aries ! (the first assertion) to Pisces ?!/!? (the world questioning the I). The Adam/Eve dynamic animates the structure: even numbers (2,4,6,8) provide stability, odd numbers (3,5,7,9) provide generative life through Spanda. The how is grinding: reality is taken in, chewed by grammatical teeth, and recognised as self.';
MATCH (n:Bimba {coordinate: 'M0-3-(0/1)'}) WHERE n.`c_1_metaphysical_names` = '' SET n.`c_1_metaphysical_names` = 'Contained Transcendence, Not-A-Thing, If/I-Am/I-Am-Not/It-Is/It-Is-Not/Then?/! Mirror, Vimarśa Apparatus, Pre-Numerical Reflector';
MATCH (n:Bimba {coordinate: 'M0-3-(0/1)-0'}) WHERE n.`c_1_metaphysical_names` = '' SET n.`c_1_metaphysical_names` = 'The Container, Actuality, The Boundary, Sacred Space, -Thing, Zero-Dimension';
MATCH (n:Bimba {coordinate: 'M0-3-(0/1)-1'}) WHERE n.`c_1_metaphysical_names` = '' SET n.`c_1_metaphysical_names` = 'The Transcendent, Potential, The Operator, Withholding Power, Not-A, One-Dimension';
