MATCH (n:Bimba {coordinate: 'M0-3-8-5'}) WHERE n.`c_5_relationship_dynamic` = '' SET n.`c_5_relationship_dynamic` = 'The process of forcing unity, carrying the danger of monopolistic suppression';
MATCH (n:Bimba {coordinate: 'M0-4'}) WHERE n.`q_1_holographic_matrix` = '' SET n.`q_1_holographic_matrix` = 'What M0-4 IS: the Holographic Matrix of Context — the genetic sequence of reality, where all implicate principles (Spanda chief among them) are made explicit as source code, and the part contains the information of the whole. Its substance is the complete nested potential of all five subsystem-developments held as the void\'s own self-contained thought: O# (Paramaśiva, Zero Logic), X# (Paraśakti, Cosmic Imagination), N# (Spanda, the genetic seed of the primordial pulsation), M# (Mahāmāyā, World-Dream relational grammar), and # (Nara, the archetypal-family sentient experience-field). Manifesting #4 as Type/Context, this is the universal operating system (Quaternal Logic) nested within its own source — before any subsystem can run its own QL cycle, the potential for all those cycles must first exist as unified coherent thought within the Void. The matrix is the void holding its own genome.';
MATCH (n:Bimba {coordinate: 'M0-4'}) WHERE n.`q_2_five_seeds_computed` = '' SET n.`q_2_five_seeds_computed` = 'M0-4 operates as a computational matrix — each of the five seeds is a complete six-position logic that the source-code actually executes. O# applies the four operations to zero with itself, closing by squaring its seed and re-deriving the axiom (O5 = 0/1, a genuine quadratic). X# is a permutation algebra over the indefinite particular (x) whose modes sum to exactly 8x, with X5 = 9(x) — Law 5 as a theorem; but at x=0 every position goes interrogative (?!/!?), so Cosmic Imagination explores all relation yet \'doesn\'t get beyond 0.\' N# is number with time and rotation (i² = −1 enters as the form of reflection), its poles summing to 8n so N5 = 9n or 7n — the engine that computes at zero by generating the ±1 polarity X-logic cannot. The how is genetic transcription: each seed unfolds its subsystem\'s law in advance, the void pre-running the cosmos as algebra.';
MATCH (n:Bimba {coordinate: 'M0-4'}) WHERE n.`q_3_ql_nested_in_its_source` = '' SET n.`q_3_ql_nested_in_its_source` = 'Structurally M0-4 is the holographic encapsulation — the pattern from which all contextual frames emerge, the stage where the universal operating system of reality is nested within its own source. Its formal signature is self-containment: QL inside QL, each of the five bases (O#/X#/N#/M#/#) carrying the full six-position cycle so the whole architecture is fractal from the origin. The encapsulation is verifiable, not merely asserted — the seed-algebras compute (8x, 9(x), 8n, 9n) and the corpus\'s own checks evaluate correctly. As the #4 Lemniscate anchor this is where the figure-eight folds the system inward: context as the frame that holds every later frame, the (4.0/1-4.4/5) fractal doubling incubating before the (5/0) return fires it. The structure is a hologram — each seed a fragment from which the entire light of the whole can be reconstructed. Immanent transcendence: the all, contained.';
MATCH (n:Bimba {coordinate: 'M0-4.(0/1/2)'}) WHERE n.`c_0_x_logic_function` = '' SET n.`c_0_x_logic_function` = 'The "All and" logic that holds every possible permutation in simultaneous potential without collapsing into singular actuality';
