MATCH (n:Bimba {coordinate: 'M0-4.(5/0)-0'}) WHERE n.`c_0_tao_synthesis` = '' SET n.`c_0_tao_synthesis` = 'The entire family structure synthesizes at #0-4.5/0-5 (Tao) where quaternio achieves perfect harmony, with position 4 + value 5 = 9 revealing family integration as path to wholeness.';
MATCH (n:Bimba {coordinate: 'M0-4.(5/0)-0'}) WHERE n.`c_0_universal_template` = '' SET n.`c_0_universal_template` = 'Provides the archetypal template that structures all subsequent family dynamics';
MATCH (n:Bimba {coordinate: 'M0-4.(5/0)-0'}) WHERE n.`c_1_wholeness_formula_seed` = '' SET n.`c_1_wholeness_formula_seed` = 'Seeds the feminine Mother/Daughter mystery: 9/5/4/0 where wholeness (9) discovers quintessence (5) requires ground (4) that is void (0). The wholeness (9) plus three odd numbers constitute the 4 feminine components.';
MATCH (n:Bimba {coordinate: 'M0-4.(5/0)-0'}) WHERE n.`c_5_integration_principle` = '' SET n.`c_5_integration_principle` = 'Aligns with QL Position 5 as integration, specifically as the universal template that enables all archetypal expression';
MATCH (n:Bimba {coordinate: 'M0-4.(5/0)-1'}) WHERE n.`c_0_feminine_four` = '' SET n.`c_0_feminine_four` = 'Daughter embodies three-quarters of the 4 feminine components in the 4/(8)/3/(4) formula: the three odd Eve numbers (3,5,7) providing generative animation. The fourth component is Mother as wholeness (9).';
MATCH (n:Bimba {coordinate: 'M0-4.(5/0)-1'}) WHERE n.`c_0_mother_daughter_mystery` = '' SET n.`c_0_mother_daughter_mystery` = 'Daughter IS Eve as Daughter of God - emerging from four-fold zero ground (0,1,0/1,(-)), inheriting foundational character but transforming stability into mobility, being into becoming, presence into process. The subdominant Yin as receptive learning aspect.';
MATCH (n:Bimba {coordinate: 'M0-4.(5/0)-4'}) WHERE n.`c_0_mother_daughter_mystery` = '' SET n.`c_0_mother_daughter_mystery` = 'Mother IS the 9 in Mother/Daughter formula (9/5/4/0) - wholeness itself at #0-2-9 (Paramesvara), the culmination containing all virtues and archetypal functions. The completion that through digital root reduction returns to 0. The fruit of the Tree pregnant with seeds for next cycle.';
