MATCH (n:Bimba {coordinate: 'M1-1'}) WHERE n.`q_5_heartbeat_handed_on` = '' SET n.`q_5_heartbeat_handed_on` = 'M1-1\'s synthesis is the pulse it generates: Bimba and Pratibimba, held in Reflective Distinction (0 =/≠ 1), tremble — and the tremble is Spanda\'s first beat. Read as Paramasiva\'s position-1, the reflection\'s closure is not rest but rhythm: the (=) and (≠) cannot resolve, so they oscillate, and the oscillation is the heartbeat handed forward to Ananda\'s harmony (#1-2) and Spanda\'s engine (#1-3). The 5→0 lives here as recognition-becoming-ground: what Pratibimba achieves — the Original known — immediately sediments as the established dyad on which all further development stands, the first manifestational logic now in place. The mirror, having reflected, becomes the surface the next stage writes on. Form fulfilled is rhythm begun: the answer to the call is itself a call. The reflection completes by refusing to settle — and that refusal is the living pulse the whole cosmos will beat to.';
