MATCH (n:Bimba {coordinate: 'M1-3-5'}) WHERE n.`c_1_spanda_completion` = '' SET n.`c_1_spanda_completion` = 'Represents Spanda\'s completion of its preparatory work - all equation-level potentials are now ready for formalization';
MATCH (n:Bimba {coordinate: 'M1-4'}) WHERE n.`q_0_percentile_inheritance` = '' SET n.`q_0_percentile_inheritance` = 'M1-4\'s ground is the 100% Spanda hands it: the percentile identity (1/1) achieved at #1-3-5, now \'materia prima for the Quaternal Logic subsystem.\' Its void-pole is the threshold-condition — everything Spanda generated remained equation, pre-formal, \'a fractal pre-echo\'; QL stands on potential that has not yet been built. Manifesting #4 within Paramasiva — the Lemniscate anchor where outward process folds inward to incubate — its horizon is the not-yet-formalised: the puncture-principle present as equation, the torus-generation potentials contained but not yet construction-syntax. The from-where is the 16/9 about to be parsed: #1-4.0 receives the 100% and transforms it into 64/36 = 16/9 = 4²/3², but at the lip of position-4 that ratio is still seed, not architecture. The ground here is the complete equation awaiting its formal realisation — the percentile whole, poised to become the grammar of all manifestation. Spanda\'s last beat is QL\'s first axiom.';
MATCH (n:Bimba {coordinate: 'M1-4'}) WHERE n.`q_3_nested_quaternity_with_dot` = '' SET n.`q_3_nested_quaternity_with_dot` = 'Structurally M1-4 is the Nested Quaternity — the only position carrying the flowering operator (.), where the quaternary \'swallows\' positions 0-3 into itself as (4.0-4.5), the single context-frame with an inner rhythm: explicate whole (4) → implicate ground (.0) → explicate positions (.1-.4) → implicate synthesis (.5). The dot is law, not convenience: hyphens link structurally, slashes mark reflective union, but dots appear ONLY after #4 — the hard requirement marking the nesting threshold where the regressive .0 reaches into implicate depths and the progressive .5 nests transcendence within immanence. As the #4 Lemniscate anchor it is the figure-eight folding the system inward, incubating the (4.0/1-4.4/5) fractal doubling before any (5/0) return. Its formal signature is the emergent Map-Compass-Lens metasymbol: Map (triangular, #0-3 angular logic), Compass (square/tetrahedron, #4 orientational stability), Lens (pentagon/diamond, #5 infinite reflectivity) — dimensional progression 2D→3D→4D+ generated ontogenically. This is where the theoretical 4+2=6 first becomes operational reality (at #1-4.4). The structure is the quaternary that contains its own recursion: a form that can apply itself to itself without collapse.';
MATCH (n:Bimba {coordinate: 'M1-4.1'}) WHERE n.`c_1_architectural_function` = '' SET n.`c_1_architectural_function` = 'Creation of the primary epistemic encoding structures accounting for 4-fold and 6-fold epistemic architectures';
