MATCH (n:Bimba {coordinate: 'M1-5-3'}) WHERE n.`c_1_architectural_function` = '' SET n.`c_1_architectural_function` = 'Shadow Integration Framework and Negation-Point Gateway: Provides mathematical formalism showing opposition as phase-relationship rather than ontological difference. Establishes that integration requires actual traversal THROUGH π (not avoidance). Transforms Jungian shadow work from psychological metaphor into topological necessity. Shows why both negation points must be passed for complete individuation. Illuminates projection mechanism: attributing to external others what exists internally at θ+π phase.';
MATCH (n:Bimba {coordinate: 'M1-5-3'}) WHERE n.`c_1_connection_to_1_3` = '' SET n.`c_1_connection_to_1_3` = 'Spanda pulsation includes both outward toward manifestation AND inward toward dissolution';
MATCH (n:Bimba {coordinate: 'M1-5-3'}) WHERE n.`c_1_connection_to_1_4` = '' SET n.`c_1_connection_to_1_4` = 'QL positions include two pairs of negation points: Pos 1 and 2, Pos 3 and 4';
MATCH (n:Bimba {coordinate: 'M1-5-3'}) WHERE n.`c_1_operational_symbolics` = '' SET n.`c_1_operational_symbolics` = 'Euler formula at negation: e^(iπ) = cos(π) + i·sin(π) = -1 + 0i = -1. Shadow = e^(i(θ+π)) = e^(iθ)·e^(iπ) = -e^(iθ). Real part: Re(e^(iθ))=cos(θ), Re(e^(i(θ+π)))=-cos(θ). Integration: ∫_θ^(θ+2π) e^(iθ\') dθ\' includes both +1 and -1 regions.';
MATCH (n:Bimba {coordinate: 'M1-5-5'}) WHERE n.`c_1_architectural_function` = '' SET n.`c_1_architectural_function` = 'Necessity Demonstration and Ultimate Recognition Engine: Provides rigorous proof that ALL self-referential systems require genus-1 topology. Explains why QL has 6 positions through topological formula. Establishes cross-domain structural isomorphisms. Completes Paramasiva self-understanding (Logos recognizing its own toroidal form as necessary). Prepares for strange-loop return where position 5 returns to position 0 transformed, which returns to position 0 (Anuttara) with full topological understanding.';
