MATCH (n:Bimba {coordinate: 'M2-5'}) WHERE n.`c_2_philosophical_foundation` = '' SET n.`c_2_philosophical_foundation` = 'Embodies the hermetic axiom "as above, so below" through mathematical precision. The 9:8 ratio emerges as the archetypal signature of transformation—the cosmic breath between perfect stability (4:3) and perfect motion (3:2), enabling translation between rest and becoming. This whole-tone interval manifests Spanda\'s rhythmic pulsation at the harmonic level.';
MATCH (n:Bimba {coordinate: 'M2-5'}) WHERE n.`c_2_venusian_bridge` = '' SET n.`c_2_venusian_bridge` = 'The profound secret: Venus at scale degree 2 carries the exact 9:8 ratio that transforms Parashakti into Mahamaya. This means the entire 72→64 transformation is fundamentally an act of BEAUTY. Not reduction but aesthetic refinement.';
MATCH (n:Bimba {coordinate: 'M2-5-(0/1)'}) WHERE n.`c_2_harmonic_role` = '' SET n.`c_2_harmonic_role` = 'Perfect consonance at both positions, creating the frame within which all other intervals resonate';
